lua","source":"+Curse","source_tag":"_t","target":"+诅咒"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"028d7c0feb97aef63a9701c9b5c424fcd5cf460505b726c63b6ac083a7e08a85","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"69c3184cefb97f76ad0726c5e47f1528b76cebe8618cbcec5fa2a065d90f3085","logical_entry_identity":"2b5f7a9e4ad87555a140cddd0bd225b77b3959d4ca0dbba94d25157db7141fab","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Beautifully detailed with images of King Toknor's defence of Last Hope. Despair fills the hearts of even the blackest villains at the sight of it.","source_tag":"_t","target":"精细描绘着国王图库纳为最后的希望浴血的影像。即便是彻头彻尾的恶棍看到它，心底也会充满深深的绝望。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"730c58e743c874f7c7eb1b3b93ca1d02546ac151cd9c544762439e02396894ea","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"69c35550a15416560a01932a25e07799c5899ebabada3049b9eb298bf7ad39d1","logical_entry_identity":"cf269057b3532764e88bb50640aacbdd0a5f2e2976b2b9647e39dd82940da498","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You have found a small iron acorn which you keep as a reminder of your past","source_tag":"_t","target":"你找到了一个小小的铁质橡果，将它保留下来，作为对过去的提醒。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3e19a3a2a9cd5a48f0f2a27b30f89b2a4ad2917bd9b0158f100c76d4da089d62","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"69c482f3b656c220975e7e0c795766ebf8b699d62468d0060ea37abecbfb2aad","logical_entry_identity":"c006750306ec833302f69fbc32d2ca1532f218724a3e5a7649a3333acbc62fd1","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Proceed to the next Infinite Dungeon level with -7 sight range for a reward.","source_tag":"_t","target":"在-7视野下到达无尽地下城的下一层，以获得奖励。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4d6a6350990f10d5ea59e4c4334b149cfb3a0a40be1cf12c4b7d725773dc044e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"69c5b9ce75211cd812748e9beaef0ce91bdda87f3ceae5d68c37416fd73ee5c1","logical_entry_identity":"84e25f3cc7f93a47588016fda8f011739419b3e8d5fd100fd73c6b36fad87760","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"diamond","source_tag":"entity name","target":"钻石"},{"